  "gotchas": [
    "Idempotency-Key is not supported here: calling twice creates two separate sessions (nothing is charged until one is paid).",
    "fee_charge_mode is silently ignored unless the merchant account has ALLOW_CLIENT_OVERRIDE enabled.",
    "The API key needs the PAYIN or BOTH scope, otherwise the call returns 403.",
    "return_url only brings the customer back after a successful payment: after a failed or cancelled one it is not used, the customer sees a Retry button and must close the tab, so don't depend on a redirect to your site for failures.",
    "Amounts are decimal strings (\"5000.00\"), never floats."
  ],
  "open_questions": [
